{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50256","headline":"登临川仙台观南亭 · 李翔","name":"登临川仙台观南亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独倚危栏爱景晴，古松坛殿半阴横。\n东山有路干云险，汝水无波到底清。\n归洞鬬龙收雨脚，拂檐行雁起秋声。\n开襟正是忘机处，不觉疏钟遍郡城。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}